# Template Lock Rule

The layout structure of the site is locked.

Cursor must NOT modify:

- SiteHeader
- SiteFooter
- PageShell
- CodeBlock component structure
- Callout component structure
- Prose component structure

Cursor may ONLY modify:

- page text content
- metadata
- links to related fixes
- DNS values inside CodeBlock

Cursor MUST NOT:

- introduce inline styles
- change Tailwind classes
- alter layout hierarchy
- move or remove the One-Minute Fix section
- replace reusable components with raw HTML

If a change requires layout modification, Cursor must STOP and request approval.